## Contributing

Additions and corrections are welcome — open an issue or a pull request.

All papers live in [`data/papers.yaml`]({{REPO_URL}}/blob/main/data/papers.yaml). `README.md`, the per-task pages in `tasks/` and the [web page]({{SITE_URL}}) are generated from it by GitHub Actions, so **edit only the YAML file**:

```yaml
- title: Paper Title
  authors: [First Author, Second Author]
  venue: CVPR            # short name; use "arXiv" for preprints
  year: 2024
  type: conference       # conference | journal | workshop | preprint
  task: [pose, dataset]  # one or more of: pose | mesh | tracking | detection |
                         #   segmentation | gesture recognition | sign language | action recognition |
                         #   dataset | simulation
  doi: 10.1109/xxxx      # optional (DOI or URL)
  project: https://...   # optional
  arxiv: 2403.07346      # optional (arXiv ID or URL)
  code: https://...      # optional
  tags: [egocentric]     # optional free-form keywords
```

To preview locally:

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
python scripts/build.py      # writes README.md, tasks/*.md and site/*.html
open site/index.html
```
